    "description": "\ud83c\udfb0\ud83c\udf89Welcome to Baba Wild Slots Casino\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udfb0\r\n\r\nThe search is over. Baba Wild Slots casino has everything you would expect from an online free casino game. The perfect Las Vegas experience anytime, anywhere, easily available on your mobile phone and all for free!\r\n\r\nAre you up to the thrill of our online casino? Start with an incredible free welcome bonus of 100,000,000 Coins(!) and try your luck on one of our most popular slot games:\r\n\r\n\u00b7 777 Burning Hot \u2013 Can you handle the heat? Then this slot machine is perfect for you.\r\n\u00b7 Cash Temple \u2013 Feel like going on an adventure? Hop on to our most popular slot game.\r\n\u00b7 Colossal Madness \u2013 Take the buffalo by the horns! More ways to win than any other casino slot game.\r\n\u00b7 Zeus Almighty \u2013 Play against Zeus for the ultimate casino jackpot!\r\n\u00b7 Wheel of Wealth \u2013 Prove you've got a lucky hand and spin the wheel to win the jackpot at this slot game!\r\n\u00b7 Leprechaun's Jackpot \u2013 Follow the Rainbow! You're guaranteed the jackpot!\r\n\u00b7 Grand Gorilla \u2013 Jungle feeling and big wins! Just the right slot game for the fearless!\r\n\r\nBut our slot games aren't the only thing Baba Wild Slots has to offer. In addition to the free daily bonus, the lobby and store bonuses, which you can collect several times a day, we also have the following extras ready for you at the casino:\r\n\ud83d\udc8c Stamp Album - Win special envelopes, complete collections and win extra coins.\r\n\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Lucky Claw - In this machine, Duplicated Stamps can be redeemed for great prizes.\r\n\ud83c\udccf Scratch Card \u2013 Every card is a winner!\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Tournaments - Compete against each other! Our casino game offers different slot machines for each tournament to help you.\r\n\ud83d\udc16 Missy the Coin Saver - Gives you Extra Coins to play and enjoy more in the casino.\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Missions Royale \u2013 This casino has Daily and weekly challenges with amazing prizes.\r\n\ud83e\udd3c Squads - Help your squad team to beat the others and become number 1 and win big!\r\n\ud83c\udfc5 Champion of the Day - You have 24 hours to prove to the whole casino that you are the champion of your group.\r\n\u263a\ufe0f League of Winners \u2013 Many roads lead to glory at Baba Wild Slots.\r\n\ud83d\udc06 Baba Chase - Hunt for coins, envelopes, scratch cards and other great prizes by completing various tasks in our casino.\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Puzzles - Different levels of difficulty and increasing wins. The more you play our slot machines, the more puzzle pieces you can win.\r\n\ud83d\udee3\ufe0f Quests \u2013 Exciting adventures lead you through various slot machines to your goal.\r\n\ud83d\udd2b Fun Fairs \u2013 Feel like you're at a real fair. Different shooting ranges offer fun and great prizes.\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Clubs \u2013 Rise from millionaire to trillionaire and get better bonuses and offers.\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 High Rollers Lounge - For thrill-seekers who want to play bolder. High Roller Casino slots are waiting for you!\r\n\ud83e\ude99 VIP Levels - Climb the VIP ladder and benefit from extra coins, gifts and bonuses.\r\n\r\nSo, what are you waiting for? The jackpot doesn't win itself. Download the Baba Wild Slots - Casino Games free app now, get your welcome bonus and let's get started!\r\n\r\nYou can also find us on Facebook! Give us a \"Like\" and get even more freebies for our slots games there: https://www.facebook.com/babawildslots/\r\nImportant instructions:\r\nv Baba Wild Slots - Casino Games is intended for persons over 18 years of age\r\nv Baba Wild Slots - Casino Games does not offer real money prizes or opportunities to win and withdraw real money.\r\nv Baba Coins are virtual and have no real monetary value and cannot be exchanged.\r\nv Social casino games do not help you have more success in real money games.\r\nv Baba Wild Slots offers purchase options.",
